# Chapter 1 — Before Fight 1 (Kael vs. Rhex)

@music main_theme
@card DAY 4 OF DARKNESS | The Abandoned Training Ground
@bg training_ground
> We return to the training ground. Kael and Rhex stand facing each other.
@show left kael
@show right rhex
RHEX [smile]: Funny, isn't it? After all this time, we're standing in the same place where we used to train.
KAEL: Except we used to fight without trying to kill each other.
RHEX: Those were weaker days.
KAEL [sad]: We were happy.
RHEX [determined]: You were happy. I was waiting for something better.
> Rhex lifts his axe. Black flames spread across its blade.
KAEL [shocked]: Where did you get that power?
RHEX: From someone who understands what strength is worth.
KAEL: Auren gave you everything you needed to become a great fighter.
RHEX: Auren taught us to hold back.
> Kael draws his sword.
KAEL: He taught us when not to fight.
RHEX [angry]: Then he taught you how to die.
KAEL [determined]: I'm not leaving without an answer. Where is the Centroid?
RHEX [smile]: Beat me, and perhaps I'll tell you.
@title FIGHT 01 | Kael vs. Rhex
